sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant W as Web
  participant A as API
  participant D as DB
  U->>+W: open page
  W->>+A: GET /items
  A->>+D: SELECT *
  D-->>-A: rows
  A-->>-W: JSON
  W-->>-U: render
  loop every 30s
    W->>A: poll
    alt changed
      A-->>W: new data
      W->>U: refresh
    else same
      A-->>W: 304
    end
  end
  Note over U,D: end of session
